        "TileImage": "$($repository e2422ec7-1adc-4121-8b02-3d7001d8b6b7).Image",
        "Description": "Those puddles in the toilet area are unsafe (and unsanitary). Zheng hasn&apos;t put a &quot;Wet Floor&quot; sign down so if he goes, I&apos;m sure things will spiral. &quot;Oh no, they&apos;ve fallen!&quot;, witnesses shout. Let&apos;s hope their fright doesn&apos;t disrupt anything else delicate. Would be a shame if a researcher spilt their drink... This contract was made by linux_penguin for the HITMAN Community Roadmap. Join our discord at https://hitman.community/discord for more information!",
